## unit 1: gnyis pa ni phung po dang 'chi bdag dang lha 'i bu dang nyon mongs pa ste bdud bzhi las rgyal ba 'i thub pa mchog gi gsung rab rtag chad kyi mtha' dang bral ba rgya mtsho 'i klong ltar dpag tu med pa las mdo sde dang rgyud sde rnams dang klu sgrub dang thogs med la sogs pa 'i bstan bcos dang chos rje 'bri gung pa chen po 'i man ngag zab mo 'i don klu rgyal gyi gtsug gi nor bu ltar bkur 'os pa 'i nang nas ma rtogs pa r dang log pa r rtog pa dang the tshom gyi dri ma med pa r bsdus pa 'di ni rin chen rnams kyi mchog baidur+ya la gsol ba btab na dgos 'dod thams cad 'byung ba bzhin gnas skabs dang mthar thug gi don thams cad 'grub pa r byed pa 'i bstan bcos gzhi dang lam dang 'bras bu gsum du bstan pa 'i snying po bshad pa r bya 'o
